    <string name="privacy_dns">While Kervan is on, apps are given the DNS resolver shown under Diagnostics. Its operator applies its own privacy policy.</string>
    <string name="privacy_check">A connection check contacts only the selected address, and only when you start it. That site sees a request from your IP address. Answers are not stored.</string>
    <string name="privacy_storage">Settings stay on this phone and are excluded from backup. Engine messages and check results go to the Activity list and the Android system log, with a custom address reduced to its host name.</string>
    <string name="privacy_local_proxy">While Kervan is on, its engine listens on this phone\'s loopback address without a password, so another app on this phone could connect to it.</string>
